{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinitrap Rehamstered: Brutal Traps, Endless Deaths, and Treasure Beyond Your Wildest Dreams! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Nightmare!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Ohio Jack, a fearless treasure hunter who\u2019s not afraid to die\u2014a lot. <i>Infinitrap Rehamstered</i> is a fast-paced, hardcore platformer designed to test your reflexes, patience, and sanity. Perfect for fans of challenging games like <i>Super Meat Boy</i> and <i>I Wanna Be The Guy,\u00a0</i>this game is not for the faint-hearted. Do you have what it takes to survive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corpse Bridges:</strong> Death isn\u2019t a setback; it\u2019s a strategy! Dead bodies persist and can be used as platforms, helping you reach new areas or avoid traps on subsequent runs. Sometimes, death is the answer, my friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Editor:</strong> Build your own dungeons, lure unsuspecting adventurers! / Break out of other peoples' dungeons! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 Story Levels:</strong> Navigate through a labyrinth of relentless traps, spike pits, and hidden surprises. Every step could be your last\u2014so be quick, or be dead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Platforming:</strong> Tight, responsive controls ensure every jump, dodge, and dash is under your command. You\u2019ll need every ounce of skill to conquer these levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Compete for the fastest times and highest scores on each level. Perfect your runs to climb the leaderboards and earn bragging rights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Humor:</strong> Embrace the madness with a game that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously. Expect to die often\u2014and laugh just as much!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Aesthetic, Modern Twist:</strong> Enjoy pixel art that pays homage to classic platformers, with smooth animations and polished visuals in this \u201cRehamstered\u201d edition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You Ready to Face the Infinitrap?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you crave the thrill of overcoming impossible odds and laugh in the face of danger, <i>Infinitrap Rehamstered</i> is your next obsession. Whether you\u2019re a speedrunner aiming for perfection or just a glutton for punishment, your ultimate challenge awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Join Ohio Jack on his deadly quest for treasure\u2014if you dare!</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >discord  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Our Discord </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"88101efb293454e3dc0784c5fcac0c00eb266f62.jpg","localized_name":"Game Completed","name":"Game Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/908390/88101efb293454e3dc0784c5fcac0c00eb266f62.jpg"},{"icon":"8b0845957eff5c39f04fb6b7a5ffebeda49a8af7.jpg","localized_name":"You beat Culsu","name":"You beat Culsu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/908390/8b0845957eff5c39f04fb6b7a5ffebeda49a8af7.jpg"},{"icon":"e26aa72c44aaa066f8ceeaed6c148ff7b2ef50eb.jpg","localized_name":"Died 10 times","name":"Died 10 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/908390/e26aa72c44aaa066f8ceeaed6c148ff7b2ef50eb.jpg"},{"icon":"844ef671695200b6ff0f08a443f07416ee6cb930.jpg","localized_name":"Died 100 times","name":"Died 100 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public